<title>USA: Liposome stake held by Kenneth Dart.</title>
<headline>Liposome stake held by Kenneth Dart.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kenneth Dart, president of Dart Container Corp, said Friday he holds 3,199,346 series A common shares or an 8.84 percent stake in Liposome Co Inc.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Dart said he bought the shares between October 14, 1996 and April 9 at prices ranging from $13.57 to $24 each.</p>
<p>Dart said he holds shares in the Princeton, N.J.-based drug company for investment purposes.</p>
